    with an around hook block
      runs the around hook block
    with an after hook method and block in multiple calls
      runs the after hook block and method in order
    with a before hook method and block in one call
      runs the before hook method and block in order
    with a before hook method
      runs the before hook method
    with an around hook method
      runs the around hook method
    with a before hook method and block in multiple calls
      runs the before hook block and method in order
    with inheritance
      with hooks added to ancestors at runtime
        runs hooks defined in ancestors
      with multiple ancestors
        runs hooks defined in ancestors
    with an after hook method and block in one call
      runs the after hook method and block in order
    with an around hook method and block in one call
      runs the around hook method and block in order
    with a before hook block
      runs the before hook block
    with around, before and after hooks
      runs hooks in the proper order

